{"id":"22af7ddf028d77a4","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-tree9-rank-homogeneous-tree.md","title":"ZFC Tree9 Rank Homogeneous Tree","display":"df-zfc-tree9-rank-homogeneous-tree — ZFC Tree9 Rank Homogeneous Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree9-rank-homogeneous-tree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree9-rank-homogeneous-tree"],"display":"df-zfc-tree9-rank-homogeneous-tree — ZFC Tree9 Rank Homogeneous Tree","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-rank.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree9-rank-homogeneous-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree9-rank-homogeneous-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree9-rank-homogeneous-tree — ZFC Tree9 Rank Homogeneous Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"91f853557651cacc\" href=\"?note=91f853557651cacc\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-rank.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-rank.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,\\rho,s,t\\in V\">\\(T,\\rho,s,t\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeRank}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeRank}_S\\)</span> (well-founded-tree rank-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"91f853557651cacc\" href=\"?note=91f853557651cacc\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-rank.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-rank.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree9RankHomogeneousTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree9RankHomogeneousTree}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}rank\\text{-}homogeneous\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree9RankHomogeneousTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\rho\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeRank}_S(\\rho,T)\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall t\\in T\\;(\\operatorname{dom}(s)=\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\to\\rho(s)=\\rho(t)))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}rank\\text{-}homogeneous\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree9RankHomogeneousTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\rho\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeRank}_S(\\rho,T)\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall t\\in T\\;(\\operatorname{dom}(s)=\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\to\\rho(s)=\\rho(t)))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rank homogeneity is stated through one rank function supplied by the well-founded-tree rank predicate; nodes on the same sequence level receive the same rank.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-rank.md","status":"resolved","id":"91f853557651cacc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-rank.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-rank.md","status":"resolved","id":"91f853557651cacc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeRank}_S$ (well-founded-tree rank-function predicate, see [[../batch09/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-rank.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,\\rho,s,t\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeRank}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree9RankHomogeneousTree}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}rank\\text{-}homogeneous\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree9RankHomogeneousTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\rho\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeRank}_S(\\rho,T)\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall t\\in T\\;(\\operatorname{dom}(s)=\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\to\\rho(s)=\\rho(t)))","display":true}],"bytes":1099,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3840","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree9-rank-homogeneous-tree.md|58-df-zfc-tree9-rank-homogeneous-tree]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["91f853557651cacc"]}